A = {
150: """Oh, Vancouver? That sounds exciting. I've never been to Canada, so I'm really curious. Can I ask you a few questions? First, why did you choose Vancouver? Do you have friends or family there, or is it for work? Second, how long are you going to stay there? And what places are you planning to visit? I've heard it has beautiful mountains and beaches near the city. Also, what's the weather like there at this time of year? Is it very cold or rainy? And finally, are you going to try any local food? I'd love to hear about your trip when you come back.""",
151: """Oh, you go to the library often? That's great. I'd like to ask you a few questions about it. First, where is the library? Is it close to your house or your office? Second, what does it look like inside? Is it big and modern, or small and quiet? Also, what do you usually do there? Do you borrow books, study, or work on your laptop? And what kinds of books do you like to borrow? Finally, how often do you go there, and do you need a membership card? I'm thinking of going to a library to study English, so your answers would really help me.""",
152: """When I was a child, I lived in a small village in the countryside, about an hour from the city. Our house was a one-story brick house with a red tile roof. In front of the house, there was a big yard where my grandmother dried rice in the sun after the harvest, and there was also a well where we got water. Behind the house, we had a small garden with vegetables, banana trees, and some chickens. The area around our house was very green and peaceful. There were rice fields everywhere, and a small river nearby where the kids used to swim in the summer. I remember the narrow dirt roads that turned into mud when it rained, and the sound of roosters every morning. Everyone in the village knew each other, so I felt very safe. It was a simple life, but full of happy memories.""",
153: """One special memory I have at home with my family is the Tet holiday when my older brother came back from abroad. He had been studying in Japan for three years and couldn't come home during that time, so it was a really big deal. A few days before he arrived, my parents cleaned and decorated the whole house, and my mother cooked all of his favorite dishes. On the night he came home, our relatives and neighbors came over to welcome him. The house was full of people, and we had a big dinner in the living room, sitting on mats on the floor because there weren't enough chairs. My brother brought gifts from Japan for everyone, and he told us funny stories about his life there. I remember my mother crying because she was so happy. It was one of the warmest nights I've ever had at home.""",
154: """When I was a child, my parents were very busy with work, so I had quite a lot of responsibilities at home. Every day after school, I had to sweep the floor and feed the chickens in our backyard. I was also expected to help my mother with cooking, for example, washing the vegetables and cooking the rice. On weekends, I helped my parents clean the house, and during the harvest season, I sometimes helped my grandparents in the rice fields. Of course, my most important responsibility was studying hard and doing my homework. To be honest, I didn't always like doing these chores, because I wanted to play with my friends. But I learned to manage my time. I usually finished my chores quickly first and then went out to play. Looking back, these responsibilities taught me to be independent and hardworking.""",
155: """I remember one time when I was about ten years old. My mother asked me to cook the rice for dinner before she came home from work, because she had to work late that day. It was a simple task, and I had done it many times before. But that afternoon, my friends came over and invited me to fly kites in the field near my house. I thought I would just play for a little while and come back in time. However, we were having so much fun that I completely forgot about the time. When I came home, it was already dark, and my mother was in the kitchen, looking very tired and disappointed. The rice wasn't ready, so dinner was late for the whole family. I felt really guilty and apologized. Since then, I've always tried to finish my responsibilities before I go out to have fun.""",
156: """Homes in my country have changed a lot over the past few years. In the past, most people lived in traditional houses, often with three generations under one roof. These days, especially in big cities, more and more people live in apartments, because land is very expensive. New apartment buildings usually have modern facilities, like swimming pools, gyms, playgrounds, and security guards. The design of homes has also changed. Modern homes are more open, with the living room and kitchen in one big space, and they have large windows to let in natural light. Another big change is technology. Many new homes have smart devices, like smart locks, security cameras, and lights or air conditioners you can control with your phone. People also care more about saving energy, so some homes now use solar panels. In general, homes today are more comfortable and convenient than before.""",
157: """Housing is a very hot topic in my country, especially in big cities like Hanoi and Ho Chi Minh City. What people discuss the most is that housing prices are getting too high. Many young people say that even if they work hard for many years, they still can't afford to buy an apartment in the city. I remember a news story from last year about apartment prices in Hanoi. It said that the price of new apartments had gone up very quickly in just one year, much faster than people's salaries, which shocked a lot of people. The story explained that there weren't enough affordable apartments, while many new projects were luxury apartments. People reacted strongly on social media. Many complained that they would have to rent forever. The government also talked about building more social housing for low-income people. I think this is a serious problem that needs to be solved soon.""",
158: """When people rent a house or an apartment, they often face several problems. The first problem is the cost. Rent in big cities keeps going up, and sometimes landlords increase the rent suddenly, so renters have to move. The second problem is the quality of the place. Some rented rooms are small, old, and don't have good ventilation, and when something breaks, some landlords are very slow to fix it. Another issue is the contract. Some landlords don't give proper contracts, so it's hard for renters to get their deposit back when they move out. To deal with these issues, people usually look for places through trusted friends or apps with reviews, and they read the contract very carefully. These problems really affect where people live. Many young workers choose to live far from the city center, where it's cheaper, even though they have to spend more time commuting.""",
159: """I think one of the most useful home appliances these days is the robot vacuum cleaner. My family bought one last year, and it has made our life much easier. People consider it useful for several reasons. First, it saves a lot of time. You just press a button or use an app on your phone, and it cleans the floors by itself, even when you're not at home. For busy working people like me, that's really helpful. Second, it's smart. It can map the house, avoid furniture, and go back to charge itself when its battery is low. Some models can even mop the floor. Third, it's good for families with kids or pets, because it keeps the floor clean every day, not just on weekends. Of course, it can't clean everything perfectly, but it's still one of the best things we've bought for our home.""",
160: """Home appliances have changed our lives in a big way. In the past, when I was a child, most housework was done by hand. My mother washed all our clothes by hand, which took hours every week, and she cooked on a small gas stove or even a wood stove. We didn't have a fridge until I was about ten, so she had to go to the market almost every day to buy fresh food. Life now is very different. We have a washing machine, a fridge, a microwave, a rice cooker, and even a robot vacuum. These machines do a lot of the work for us. I think the biggest change is the amount of free time people have. Because housework takes much less time, people can spend more time working, studying, or relaxing with their families. It has also made life easier for women, who used to do most of the housework.""",
161: """I went to the movies recently with my coworkers, about two weeks ago. It was a Friday evening, and we had just finished a big project at work, so we decided to celebrate together. There were five of us. Right after work, we went to a shopping mall near the industrial park. Before the movie, we had dinner at a Japanese restaurant in the mall, and we talked about the project and laughed about all the stressful moments we had. Then we watched a new superhero movie. It was full of action and special effects, and everyone really enjoyed it, although the story was a bit long. After the movie, we weren't ready to go home yet, so we went to a small cafe nearby, had some drinks, and talked about the movie. It was a really fun evening, and it helped our team relax after a busy month.""",
162: """Movies today are quite different from the movies I watched when I was growing up. When I was a child, I mostly watched movies on TV, and many of them were old Hong Kong action movies or Vietnamese dramas. The special effects were simple, and sometimes they looked a bit fake. Today, movies have amazing visual effects, thanks to computer technology. Everything looks very real, and the sound is much better, especially in modern theaters. Another big difference is how we watch movies. In the past, we had to wait for movies to come on TV, but now we can watch almost anything on streaming apps at any time. Also, Vietnamese movies have improved a lot, and some of them are very successful now. However, there are some similarities. Good movies, both old and new, still need an interesting story and great actors to make people feel something.""",
163: """When I talk with my friends about movies, we usually discuss a few things. First, we talk about new movies that are coming out, especially big Hollywood movies and popular Vietnamese movies, and we decide which ones are worth watching in the theater. Second, we talk about the story and the actors. We often argue about whether the ending made sense or whether a famous actor did a good job. Another topic is ticket prices, because going to the movies can be quite expensive, especially for families. Recently, we've also been talking about streaming apps, like which app has the best movies for the price. These topics are important to us because we're all busy, so we don't want to waste our time and money on a bad movie. Also, talking about movies is a fun way for us to stay connected and share our opinions.""",
164: """I'd like to compare two types of music that I enjoy, which are pop music and acoustic music. Pop music is very catchy and energetic. The songs usually have a strong beat and a simple chorus that you can remember easily. Pop songs are often about love or having fun, and they're perfect for parties or when you're driving. Acoustic music, on the other hand, is much calmer. It's usually played with just a guitar or a piano, and the singer's voice is soft and close. The lyrics are often deeper and more emotional. In terms of similarities, both types of music are very popular, especially among young people, and both can make you feel good. However, the biggest difference is the mood. I listen to pop music when I want energy, like in the morning, and acoustic music when I want to relax, like before bed.""",
165: """These days, people who love music are interested in a few new gadgets. The most popular one is wireless earbuds. They're small, comfortable, and have great sound quality, and many of them have noise-canceling features, so you can enjoy music even on a noisy bus or in a busy cafe. Another popular product is the smart speaker. You can control it with your voice, for example, saying "play some relaxing music," and it will start playing right away. They're also easy to connect to your phone. Some young people are also interested in portable Bluetooth speakers that are waterproof, so they can bring them to the beach or on camping trips. I think these products are exciting because they make listening to music easier and more convenient. You don't need wires or big machines anymore, and you can enjoy high-quality music anywhere you go.""",
166: """I'd like to compare two popular parks in my city. The first one is the big central park near the lake, and the second one is a newer park near the industrial area. In terms of similarities, both parks are clean and free to enter, and they both have walking paths, benches, and playgrounds for children. They're also very busy in the early morning and in the evening, when people go there to exercise. However, there are some clear differences. The central park is older and has big, old trees, so it's shady and peaceful. It's built around a lake, and it has a very beautiful view, especially at sunset. The newer park, on the other hand, has fewer trees, but it has more modern facilities, like a skate park, outdoor gym equipment, and a big open lawn for events. I prefer the central park because it feels more relaxing.""",
167: """Public parks in my country are facing a few challenges these days. One of the biggest issues is that there aren't enough parks for the number of people living in big cities. As cities grow, more land is used for buildings, so parks are often overcrowded, especially in the evenings and on weekends. Another problem is litter. Some people leave trash on the grass or throw it into the lakes, which makes the parks dirty. There are also problems with maintenance. In some parks, the playground equipment is old or broken, which can be dangerous for kids. I think these problems are caused by fast urban development, a lack of funding, and some people's lack of awareness. To solve them, the city should plan more green spaces when building new areas, put more trash bins in parks, and run campaigns to teach people to keep parks clean.""",
168: """Children and adults do very different activities at parks. Children usually spend most of their time at the playground. They love sliding, swinging, climbing, and running around with other kids. Sometimes they also ride bicycles, play with balls, or fly kites. Adults, on the other hand, usually go to parks to exercise and relax. Many adults go walking or jogging around the lake, and older people often do tai chi or dance to music in groups in the early morning. Some adults also just sit on benches, chat with friends, or watch their kids play. The facilities are also different. For children, there are playgrounds with colorful equipment like slides and swings, and the ground is often covered with soft material for safety. For adults, there are walking paths, benches, and outdoor exercise machines. In my opinion, a good park should have facilities for everyone.""",
169: """I think traveling within Vietnam has changed quite a lot in the past five years. One big change is that prices have gone up. Hotels, flights, and food at tourist places are more expensive than before, especially during holidays, so traveling costs more for families. Another change is that popular places have become much more crowded. For example, places like Sa Pa and Da Lat are full of tourists on weekends, and the traffic on the way there can be terrible. On the other hand, some changes have made traveling easier. There are many more new highways, so it takes less time to drive between cities. Also, booking apps make it very easy to find hotels and compare prices. Because of these changes, many travelers now plan their trips earlier, avoid traveling during peak holidays, and look for less famous places to escape the crowds.""",
170: """When it comes to trips, people usually raise a few main concerns. The first one is cost. During holidays, prices for flights and hotels can double, so many people worry about their budget. The second concern is overcrowding. Popular tourist places are often packed with people, which makes the trip stressful instead of relaxing. Another issue is safety, including traffic accidents on long road trips and food safety at street stalls. Some people also complain about tourist traps, where sellers charge foreigners or tourists much higher prices. These problems are caused by many people traveling at the same time, a lack of regulation in some places, and the fast growth of tourism. To address them, the government and local authorities are trying to control prices during holidays and improve roads. Travelers are also learning to plan ahead, read reviews online, and travel during the off-season.""",
171: """Traveling to other countries has changed a lot over the years, and I'd say it's much easier now than in the past. When I was a child, very few people in my village had ever been abroad. Flights were very expensive, and getting a visa was difficult and took a long time. People usually only went abroad for work or study, not for vacations. These days, things are very different. There are many low-cost airlines, so flights to countries like Thailand, Singapore, or Korea can be quite cheap if you book early. It's also easier to get visas for some countries, and some even offer online visas. Another big change is technology. Now we have translation apps, map apps, and booking apps, so we can plan everything ourselves. However, some things have become more complicated, like stricter security checks at airports. Overall, traveling abroad is more accessible than ever.""",
172: """When people talk about traveling to other countries, they're usually most interested in a few things. The first one is food. Many people love trying local dishes and street food, because food is a big part of experiencing a new culture. For example, Vietnamese people who go to Korea always want to try Korean barbecue. The second thing is famous landmarks and natural scenery, like old temples, famous buildings, or beautiful mountains and beaches. People want to see these places with their own eyes and take photos. Shopping is also very popular, especially for cosmetics, clothes, and electronics, because sometimes they're cheaper or better quality abroad. I think these things are important to travelers because they create special memories and help people understand how other people live. Traveling also gives people a break from their daily routine and helps them see the world from a different perspective.""",
173: """It's true that people nowadays don't go to bars just to drink. Many bars have become places for entertainment and socializing. For example, a lot of bars now have live music, so people go there to enjoy bands or acoustic performances. Sports bars are also very popular, especially during big football matches, when groups of friends go there to watch the game together on big screens. Some bars organize events like quiz nights or karaoke nights. There are also rooftop bars, where people go mainly to enjoy the view of the city and take photos. In the past, bars in my country were mostly simple places where men drank beer after work. These days, bars are more modern and stylish, and more young people and women go there. Some bars even serve non-alcoholic drinks and good food, so they're more like places to relax and meet friends.""",
174: """I remember a news story about a police inspection at bars a few years ago. After a terrible fire at a karaoke bar in another city, where many people died, the authorities started checking bars and karaoke places all over the country for safety. In my city, the police and firefighters visited many bars and karaoke places. According to the news, they found that a lot of them didn't have proper fire exits, fire extinguishers, or safety licenses. Some places had their emergency exits blocked or locked. Many of these businesses were ordered to close until they fixed the problems. The news showed pictures of police putting closure notices on the doors of some popular bars. Many people supported this action, because they realized how dangerous some of these places were. Since then, I always look for the emergency exits when I go to a bar or a karaoke place.""",
175: """I've noticed that many restaurants in my country are changing their menus because customers are more health-conscious now. First, more restaurants are offering salads and healthy bowls, with lots of vegetables, grains, and lean meats like chicken or fish. A few years ago, salads were not very common in Vietnamese restaurants. Second, many restaurants now show calorie information on their menus or describe how the food is cooked, like grilled or steamed instead of fried. Third, there are more vegetarian and vegan options. Even some traditional restaurants now offer a vegetarian version of their dishes. Also, many coffee shops and bubble tea shops now let you choose less sugar or no sugar, which is a big change. I think this trend is great, because it makes it easier for busy people like me to eat healthy even when we don't have time to cook at home.""",
176: """I've been to both chain restaurants and small local restaurants many times. For example, last month I took my daughter to a famous fried chicken chain in a shopping mall. Everything was predictable. The menu was the same as in every other branch, the food came out very quickly, and it tasted exactly the same as always. The restaurant was clean and bright, but it felt a bit like a factory. A week later, I went to a small local restaurant near my house that serves northern Vietnamese food. There was no menu on the wall, and the owner just told us what they had cooked that day. The food was home-style and delicious, and the owner chatted with us like we were neighbors. The biggest difference for me was the atmosphere. Chain restaurants are convenient and consistent, but local restaurants feel more personal and unique.""",
177: """I've noticed several changes in eating out over the last few years. In the past, when I was a child, my family rarely ate out. It was something we only did for special occasions, like birthdays, and we usually went to simple local restaurants. These days, people eat out much more often, even on normal weekdays. There are also many more kinds of restaurants, including Korean, Japanese, and Western food, which were rare before. Another big change is food delivery. With delivery apps, people can order food from almost any restaurant and get it in thirty minutes, so many people eat restaurant food at home. I think these changes happened because people have higher incomes and busier lives now, so they have less time to cook. Also, social media has made food trends very popular, and young people like trying new restaurants and sharing photos online.""",
178: """When my friends and family talk about restaurants, they usually discuss a few main things. The first one, of course, is the taste of the food. They talk about whether the food is fresh, flavorful, and worth the price. The second characteristic is the price. My friends always compare whether a restaurant is reasonable or too expensive for what you get. Another thing they often mention is the service. If the staff are friendly and fast, people feel welcome, but if the service is slow or rude, it can ruin the whole meal. Cleanliness is also very important, especially the bathrooms and the kitchen area. Finally, the atmosphere matters, like whether it's quiet for a family dinner or lively for a party. All these things affect the dining experience, because even if the food is good, a dirty place or bad service can make people never come back.""",
179: """I think fast-food and delivery restaurants have started offering healthy choices for several reasons. The main reason is consumer pressure. People in my country are more aware of health problems, like obesity and diabetes, and they're reading more about nutrition online. So they started asking for healthier food, and restaurants had to respond. For example, many fried chicken chains now offer grilled chicken and salads. Another reason is market forces. There's a lot of competition among restaurants, especially on delivery apps, so offering healthy options helps them attract a new group of customers, like office workers who want a quick but healthy lunch. Social media also plays a role, because healthy eating and fitness are trendy now, and many influencers promote them. So I think it's a mix of customer demand and business strategy. Either way, it's a positive change for people's health.""",
}
